### 3. **A03 – Injection (Future Risk / Missing Defense-in-Depth)**
**Severity: Medium (currently latent, high risk at scale)**

The app has no body parser or query-parameter validation. As soon as any route consumes `req.query`, `req.body`, or `req.params`, it will be wide open to **SQL injection, NoSQL injection, or command injection** with no sanitization layer in place.

```js
// ❌ VULNERABLE: No body parsing or validation configured at all
const app = express();
// req.body will be undefined; devs will add ad-hoc parsing later without validation
```

**Fix:** Add `express.json()` with size limits and a validation library (`zod` or `express-validator`) from the start.

```js
